DEVOPS ===> Development + Operation


SDLC =====> Software Deveopment Life Cycle

Proceess Of SDLC(software Development Life Cycle):
1.Requirements
2.Analysis
3.Design
4.Developer(code build)
5.Testing
6.Verification and Release

This Proceess followed by make three methodlogies:
1.Water Fall methodlogy
2.Agile methodlogy
3.Devops methodlogy

Water Fall methodlogy:
    Linear Sequence it's traditional way
Analysis ==> design ==> implementation ==> testing ==> Maintenance
inflexibility Changes ===> phase is complete
late Testing ===> project high risk
customer involement ===> not user satisfication
delivery delayed

Agile Methodlogy:
    iterative and flexible approach
    Sprint meeting

Advaandages:
